      "name": "Wedding car with chauffeur",
      "description": "A wedding car with chauffeur: an S-Class or 7 Series, or a Rolls-Royce Ghost or Bentley Flying Spur on request. Guests moved alongside.",
      "serviceType": "Wedding car with chauffeur",
